She moves cautiously through the cargo car, sniffing at the various crates and bundles. Her keen senses pick up the faint scent of food, and she follows it to a small, unmarked crate near the back of the car. Using her paws and teeth, she manages to pry the crate open slightly, revealing a stash of dried meat and a small water flask.

Lassie carefully takes a piece of the dried meat and the flask, knowing they will help sustain her energy for the final leg of her journey. She places the flask in a secure corner and eats a small portion of the meat, feeling her strength return.

As she continues her exploration, Lassie notices a folded piece of paper tucked under a loose floorboard. She pulls it out with her teeth and unfolds it carefully. The paper contains a map of the railway route, with a marked location near the Carraclough farm. Lassie’s tail wags excitedly as she realizes this map will help her navigate the final stretch of her journey.

With the map and resources secured, Lassie feels more prepared than ever. She returns to her resting spot, her heart filled with hope and determination. The train rumbles on, carrying her closer to Timmy and the reunion she has been striving for.
===GAME END===

